# Follow through the whole thread

If the developer is thinking out loud across several messages, **inventory
every ask in this conversation** and finish each one before treating the turn
as done. The latest sentence is not a license to drop earlier ones.

Typical shape here: admit/type correctness, mag as the global axis, north-tip
picture-sanity vs hard loci for compute-health, then extra properties (e.g.
IPP). All of those stay in scope until they are in code, tests, or an explicit
deferral the developer accepted.
